                            to OLED suitability (10%), with a final-art target of
                            85/100 that stays advisory: the owner's explicit
                            approval is always required.
                        </p>
                        <div class="score-bars">
                            <div>
                                <span>Clifford Foundation 01</span>
                                <span class="bar"><i style="--score: 68.5%"></i></span>
                                <strong>68.5</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span>Flow Foundation 01</span>
                                <span class="bar"><i style="--score: 64.5%"></i></span>
                                <strong>64.5</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div class="target">
                                <span>Final-art target</span>
                                <span class="bar"><i style="--score: 85%"></i></span>
                                <strong>85</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="small">
                            From <code>docs/reviews/m1-artistic-viability.md</code> (12 October 2026). Both previews: “Refine”, medium
                            confidence.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="case-section status-section" aria-labelledby="mw-status">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">05 — Current status</p>
                    <h2 id="mw-status">A proven engine, art still in progress.</h2>
                    <p>
                        Milestone 1 was accepted as a technical and
